        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally in 2025, we enhanced our EvenMore® offering, with EvenMore® now selling via global distribution systems, providing customers more opportunities to book our premium economy offering on a single ticket through travel agents and online travel agencies.",
        "start_character": 4720,
        "end_character": 4982
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because of our network strength in leisure destinations, we also sell vacation packages through our wholly owned subsidiary, Paisly, LLC (\"Paisly\") (f/k/a JetBlue Travel Products), which offers one-stop, value-priced vacation services for self-directed packaged travel planning.",
        "start_character": 7335,
        "end_character": 7613
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Looking to the future, we plan to continue to grow in our high-value geographies, invest in industry-leading products, and provide award-winning service by our 23,000 dedicated employees, whom we refer to as crewmembers.",
        "start_character": 494,
        "end_character": 714
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, during the second quarter of 2026, we expect to begin selling United Airlines non-air ancillaries through Paisly.",
        "start_character": 11263,
        "end_character": 11390
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "On select transatlantic and coast-to-coast flights, we offer a reimagined version of our Mint® experience with a completely refreshed cabin design featuring private suites with aisle access.",
        "start_character": 5489,
        "end_character": 5679
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "State and Local - In addition to the federal regulations with which we must comply, we are also subject to state and local laws and regulations in the states in which we operate and the regulations of various local authorities operating the airports we serve.",
        "start_character": 39871,
        "end_character": 40130
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To the extent we seek to provide air transportation to additional international markets in the future, we would be required to obtain necessary authority from the DOT and the FAA as well as the applicable foreign government.",
        "start_character": 40380,
        "end_character": 40604
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate in a capital and energy intensive industry that has high fixed costs, as well as heavy taxation and fees.",
        "start_character": 1676,
        "end_character": 1792
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We provide professional and leadership development programs to elevate the performance and support the career growth of all interested crewmembers.",
        "start_character": 28167,
        "end_character": 28314
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "In the event of a downturn in our business, resulting in a reduction of flying and related work hours, we are obligated to pay these crewmembers a guaranteed level of income and continue their benefits if they do not obtain other aviation employment.",
        "start_character": 32499,
        "end_character": 32749
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We believe we deliver award-winning service and product with competitive fares that focuses on the entire customer experience, from booking an itinerary to arrival at the final destination.",
        "start_character": 2295,
        "end_character": 2484
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001158463-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001158463-26-000007-fc35b39172d578e0",
        "accession_number": "0001158463-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
